{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43968","headline":"书壁 · 周仲美","name":"书壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱妾不爱子，爲问此何理。\n弃官更弃妻，人情宁可已。\n永诀泗之滨，遗言空在耳。\n三载无朝昏，孤帏泪如洗。\n妇人义从夫，一节誓生死。\n江乡感残春，肠断晚烟起。\n西望太华峰，不知几千里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周仲美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}